{{> page-header image="/images/racing/hero.jpg" eyebrow="Racing" heading="The Industry Reality" subheading="Elite performance pushes a horse's body to its physiological limits. When oxygen demand outpaces supply, a predictable cascade of performance-limiting events begins—reducing speed, increasing injury risk, and shortening careers."}}

<section class="panel-white">
  <div class="section grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2">
    <div>
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-al-navy/55">01</p>
      <h2 class="font-display mt-2 text-2xl font-medium text-al-navy sm:text-3xl">The Race Within the Race</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-al-ink/75">Racing places extraordinary demands on the equine athlete. During intense exercise, the horse's demand for oxygen and energy can exceed its ability to maintain physiological balance. As the body shifts from efficient aerobic metabolism toward less efficient anaerobic energy production, fatigue accelerates, performance declines, recovery slows, and physiological stress begins to affect multiple interconnected body systems.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-none border border-al-line bg-al-panel p-8">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-al-navy/55">02</p>
      <h2 class="font-display mt-2 text-2xl font-medium text-al-navy sm:text-3xl">When Performance Declines, The Costs Begin</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-al-ink/75">The physiological cascade doesn't end at the finish line. Its consequences extend far beyond race day&mdash;impacting soundness, longevity, veterinary costs, and the financial success of every horse owner and trainer.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="panel-grey">
  <div class="section">
    <h2 class="font-display text-center text-2xl font-medium text-al-navy sm:text-3xl">Phases of Performance Decline in an 8 Furlong Race</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 text-center text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-red-600">Due to Insufficient Oxygen to the Muscles</p>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-3 max-w-2xl text-center text-sm text-al-ink/65">As oxygen demand exceeds supply, a physiological cascade is triggered, leading to fatigue, stress, and decline.</p>

    <div class="mt-10 overflow-x-auto rounded-none border border-al-line bg-white">
      <table class="w-full min-w-[900px] border-collapse text-left text-sm">
        <thead>
          <tr class="bg-al-navy text-white">
            <th class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold">Phase</th>
            <th class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold">Race Progress</th>
            <th class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold">What's Happening</th>
            <th class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold">Physiological Cascade</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {{#each performanceCascade}}
          <tr class="border-t border-al-line align-top odd:bg-white even:bg-al-panel">
            <td class="px-4 py-4 font-display text-lg font-medium text-al-navy/55">{{this.phase}}</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-4">
              <p class="font-semibold text-al-navy">{{this.name}}</p>
              <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-al-ink/50">{{this.range}}</p>
            </td>
            <td class="px-4 py-4 text-al-ink/70">{{this.body}}</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-4 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-al-navy">{{this.tag}}</td>
          </tr>
          {{/each}}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 overflow-hidden rounded-none border border-al-line bg-white p-6 sm:p-8">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-al-navy">Relative Performance Level</p>
      <div class="mt-5 flex items-end gap-2 sm:gap-4">
        {{#each performanceCascade}}
        <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col items-center gap-2">
          <div class="flex h-32 w-full items-end overflow-hidden rounded-md bg-al-panel">
            <div class="w-full rounded-none bg-gradient-to-t from-al-navy to-al-navy-light" style="height: {{this.level}}%"></div>
          </div>
          <p class="text-[11px] font-semibold text-al-navy">{{this.level}}%</p>
          <p class="text-center text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wide text-al-ink/50">Furlong {{this.phase}}</p>
        </div>
        {{/each}}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="panel-white">
  <div class="section max-w-3xl">
    <h2 class="font-display text-center text-3xl font-medium text-al-navy">The Effects</h2>
    <ul class="mt-8 space-y-4 text-sm text-al-ink/80">
      {{#each industryEffects}}
      <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="font-semibold text-al-navy/55">{{this.stat}}</span> {{this.body}}</li>
      {{/each}}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="panel-grey">
  <div class="section">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl rounded-none border border-al-line bg-white p-8 sm:p-10">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-al-navy/55">Owners &amp; Trainers</p>
      <p class="font-display mt-2 text-3xl font-semibold text-al-navy">Face</p>
      <div class="mt-8 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2">
        {{#each ownersTrainersFace}}
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
          <div class="flex h-11 w-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-none border border-al-navy/30 text-al-navy/55">{{{icon this.icon "w-5 h-5"}}}</div>
          <p class="pt-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-al-navy">{{this.title}}</p>
        </div>
        {{/each}}
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-8 text-center">
      <a href="/racing/kidney-homeostasis" class="btn-primary">See Kidney Homeostasis</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
